.DS_Store

# `ios/` IS checked in — it is the Capacitor shell, and regenerating it would
# lose the entitlements, the iCloud Info.plist block and the bundle id along
# with it. What must NOT be checked in is listed in `ios/.gitignore`, which
# Capacitor writes: `App/Pods`, `App/App/public` (a copy of `dist/`), the
# generated `capacitor.config.json` and `config.xml`, build output and
# `xcuserdata`. Everything there is reproduced by `npm run ios:sync`.
ios/App/Pods
ios/App/build
ios/App/output
ios/App/App/public
ios/App/App/capacitor.config.json
ios/App/App/config.xml
ios/DerivedData
ios/capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins
**/xcuserdata
